	(text "LANWAKE requires 1–4.7k pull-up. EESK requires 4.7k pull-up; low enters test mode.\nEEDI low selects Microwire, EEPROM_SEL low selects 93C46. All strap levels at power-on.\nBG pins 4/5/7 float; all 49 pads audited. 2.5G magnetics and four-pair PoE attached; qualify hardware."
